PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Commission/Forum may graciously be pleased to:

a) Direct the Opposite Party to refund the amount of Rs. {amount}/- paid by the Complainant;
b) Direct the Opposite Party to pay compensation of Rs. {compensationAmount}/- for mental agony, harassment, and deficiency in service;
c) Direct the Opposite Party to pay Rs. {litigationCost}/- as cost of litigation;
d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Commission/Forum may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice and equity.

And for this act of kindness, the complainant shall ever pray.
